        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia AP-9028P, Bilbao Refrigerator Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Bilbao Appliance Pull has an industrial chic look that makes it a great choice for designers and those with an eye for design. The modern look is very on trend, and the available finishes reflect that. Choose from 6 designer finishes including satin brass, polished chrome, and oil rubbed bronze. Omnia's 9028P Solid Brass Appliance Pull is available with 12 inch or 18 inch center to centers. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso see the matching <a href=\"//search?type=product&q=omn-9028\"><b>Bilbao Cabinet Pulls</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Omnia Ultima 9028P Appliance Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Pull Mounting: Standard 3/4\" Thick Appliance Panel</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>AP-9028P/305:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 12\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 13\"</li>\r\n<li>Face Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>AP-9028P/457:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 18\"  (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 19\"</li>\r\n<li>Face Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-C08PC3_size.gif?v=1704354638\" width=\"600\" height=\"144\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>",
